cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MUXARO — Your Media. One Powerful Workspace."
message: "If you use or reference MUXARO in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-18"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/SubhransuNayak007/muxaro"
abstract: >-
  MUXARO is an open-source, clean-room media processing workspace built with
  Next.js 14, Fastify 5, Node.js 24, and FFmpeg/FFprobe. It provides video
  conversion, audio extraction, audio/video merging, resumable chunked uploads,
  HTTP Range artifact delivery, rolling quota entitlements, and defense-in-depth
  SSRF, CSRF, IDOR, and TOTP MFA security controls.
authors:
  - alias: "SubhransuNayak007"
    given-names: "Subhransu"
    family-names: "Nayak"
keywords:
  - media-processing
  - ffmpeg
  - nextjs
  - fastify
  - typescript
  - video-converter
  - audio-extractor
  - ssrf-protection
